description.content:
**Sample Response**

Based on how many requests batched in the Generation API call, those many `jobStepResponses` will be returned.

Each one contains `documentMetadata` object with an `id`. This document corresponds to the response for each of the request in the batch. Use `documentMetadata.id` as `documentId` while making subsequent call to fetch the generated content.

```json
{
    "job": {
        "jobId": "2bd1365a-ac4b-4224-bf97-dd0c4a8c91e9",
        "name": "Generate First Image",
        "projectId": "243056",
        "status": "SUCCEEDED",
        "createdAt": "2024-03-28T20:47:32+05:30",
        "startedAt": "2024-03-28T20:47:32+05:30",
        "completedAt": "2024-03-28T20:48:26+05:30",
        "jobStepResponses": [
            {
                "status": "SUCCEEDED",
                "documentMetadata": {
                    "id": 46,
                    "name": "simple_image_0"
                }
            }
        ]
    },
    "links": [
        {
            "rel": "self",
            "href": "https://api-us.typeface.ai/batch-service/accounts/5d903776-016a-4f1d-814d-71d44a88ebd3/projects/243056/batch-jobs/2bd1365a-ac4b-4224-bf97-dd0c4a8c91e9"
        }
    ]
}
```

